    "author": "",
    "description": "Pitch-axis fixture (set 014 session 3): the Twinline family's compact staff — 12 pitch classes on 7 axis positions per octave (shared pairs C/C#, D#/E, F/F#, G#/A, A#/B), octave stride 7, 2 axis units per staff space, three staff lines per octave at axis positions 1, 3, 5, midpoint G. The upper member of each shared pair is offset 0.85 staff space right (xOffsetStaffSpaces), with the usual hollow sharps. A family fixture for the pitch-axis export and engine round-trip, not a reproduction of any one gallery record (records 32-40 disambiguate shared pairs by notehead shape). The crotchet-minim shape is the default geometry at semitoneHeight 2 (one staff space at 2 axis units per space) and carries lilypondAnchors in semitone units; its lilypondPath / lilypondHollowPath are null (there is no source SVG), so the exporter converts its SVG data (÷ SVG units per semitone, Y up, ÷ axisUnitsPerStaffSpace) and the export engraves at the size the preview shows.",
